The greed is a list of 1, 2, and 3.
The sizes is a list of 1, and 1.
The lastg is the last position of greed.
The lasts is the last position of sizes.
Sort greed.
Sort sizes.
The child is 0.
The cookie is 0.
Repeat while child is at most lastg and cookie is at most lasts.
If item cookie of sizes is at least item child of greed, add 1 to child.
Add 1 to cookie.

Show child.
